  "nba": "Flagship from data/radio-team-sports.json (2026-08-06 list) plus four teams checked against team sites 10-07 (MEM, OKC, CHI, POR). Same call sign + frequency match. The NBA schedule feed (cdn.nba.com) answers 403 to the server, so this is not refreshed from a league feed yet. IND corrected 10-07: the list's WIBC main signal is news/talk; the Pacers are on WFNI 1070 / 107.5 The Fan (heard: WIBC was airing a political talk show during the game).",
